//!
//! # Smp
//!
//! Starting the other processors.
//!
//! ## Public API
//!
//! | Name  | File        | Purpose                                                      |
//! |-------|-------------|--------------------------------------------------------------|
//! | `Smp` | `start.ign` | start every processor Limine parked, and run its own setup   |
//!
//! ## Dependencies
//!
//! | Imports   | Why                                                          |
//! |-----------|--------------------------------------------------------------|
//! | `Boot`    | the Limine MP response                                       |
//! | `Arch`    | the per-CPU GDT, TSS, block, IDT, FPU, SMEP/SMAP, `SYSCALL`  |
//! | `Mm`      | the kernel page tables, EFER.NXE, CR0.WP, PAT                |
//! | `Apic`    | each processor's local APIC                                  |
//! | `Time`    | the deadline while the boot processor waits; each AP's timer |
//! | `Sched`   | each AP's idle thread, and its entry into the scheduler      |
//! | `Drivers` | the boot report                                              |
//!
//! Only `main.ign` imports `Smp`.

import _ from "./start";

/// Aggregate namespace of the processor start code, contributed by
/// `start.ign`.
export namespace Smp {}
